Drep
$cards
DECK 2 SPADES

$initial
UHIOC 2 FACE_LAST
UHIOC 6 FACE_LAST
UHIOC 5 FACE_LAST
UHIOC 5 FACE_LAST
UHIOC 0 FACE_LAST
UHIOC 4 FACE_LAST
UHIOC 1 FACE_LAST
UHIOC 3 FACE_LAST

$moves
MOVE UHIOC UHIOC
OR
    AND
        SRC Suit {CLUBS, DIAMONDS, HEARTS, SPADES}
        DESTSRC Suit match_color
    DESTSRC Rank descending
MOVE_STACK UHIOC UHIOC
OR
    AND
        SRCSTACK Rank equal
        DESTSRC Rank add_14
    AND
        SRC Suit {DIAMONDS, SPADES, CLUBS}
        DEST Empty
$win
OR
    PILE ALL UHIOC Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL UHIOC Empty
        PILE ALL UHIOC Empty
